<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>LLM Usage Statement</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In preparing this paper, a large language model (LLM) was used solely for grammar checking and language polishing. The design and implementation of all algorithms and experiments, as well as the analysis of results and conclusions, were independently conducted and written by the authors.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Algorithm for Controlled Non-uniform Grouping</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For completeness, we provide the detailed pseudocode of our grouping scheme.
Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ A.2 Algorithm for Controlled Non-uniform Grouping ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ GRACE-MoE: Grouping and Replication with Locality-Aware Routing for Efficient Distributed MoE Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> defines the intra-group affinity score used to evaluate candidate assignments, while Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ A.2 Algorithm for Controlled Non-uniform Grouping ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ GRACE-MoE: Grouping and Replication with Locality-Aware Routing for Efficient Distributed MoE Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> gives
the full procedure for controlled non-uniform grouping with non-uniformity ratio <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Calculate Affinity Score Intra Group</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">function</span> <span id="alg1.l1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">IntraScore</span>(Affinity <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{A}}\!\in\!\mathbb{R}^{n\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑨</mi><mo lspace="0.108em" rspace="0.108em">∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{A}}\!\in\!\mathbb{R}^{n\times n}</annotation></semantics></math>, list of experts <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math>)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg1.l2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{i\in S}\sum_{j\in S}{\bm{A}}_{ij}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mo lspace="0.167em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>𝑨</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{i\in S}\sum_{j\in S}{\bm{A}}_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">function</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> Controlled Non-uniform Grouping</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
              
              
            Affinity <math id="alg2.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{A}}\!\in\!\mathbb{R}^{n\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝑨</mi><mo lspace="0.108em" rspace="0.108em">∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{A}}\!\in\!\mathbb{R}^{n\times n}</annotation></semantics></math>, number of groups <math id="alg2.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math>, non-uniformity ratio <math id="alg2.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>, number of experts <math id="alg2.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{e}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{e}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
              
              
            <math id="alg2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E\leftarrow\lfloor N_{e}/D\rfloor" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌊</mo><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E\leftarrow\lfloor N_{e}/D\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math>;  <math id="alg2.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta\leftarrow\max(1,\mathrm{round}(E\cdot r))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>round</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta\leftarrow\max(1,\mathrm{round}(E\cdot r))</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
              
              
            <math id="alg2.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="num_{\min}\leftarrow\max(1,E-\delta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">num_{\min}\leftarrow\max(1,E-\delta)</annotation></semantics></math>;  <math id="alg2.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="num_{\max}\leftarrow E+\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">num_{\max}\leftarrow E+\delta</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
              
              
            Initialize grouping <math id="alg2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L\leftarrow\{L_{1},\dots,L_{D}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L\leftarrow\{L_{1},\dots,L_{D}\}</annotation></semantics></math> as <math id="alg2.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math> empty lists.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
              
              
            Initial clusters <math id="alg2.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{C_{d}\}_{d=1}^{D}\leftarrow\textsc{SpectralClustering}({\bm{A}},D)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>D</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">SpectralClustering</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑨</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{C_{d}\}_{d=1}^{D}\leftarrow\textsc{SpectralClustering}({\bm{A}},D)</annotation></semantics></math>;  <math id="alg2.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Omega\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Omega\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg2.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg2.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg2.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg2.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|C_{d}|&gt;num_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|C_{d}|&gt;num_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
              
              
               keep top-<math id="alg2.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="num_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">num_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math> by <math id="alg2.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{j\in C_{d}}{\bm{A}}_{ij}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow></msub><msub><mi>𝑨</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{j\in C_{d}}{\bm{A}}_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math> as <math id="alg2.l8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{d}</annotation></semantics></math>;  push rest to <math id="alg2.l8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Omega" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Omega</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
              
              
               <math id="alg2.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{d}\leftarrow C_{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{d}\leftarrow C_{d}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg2.l12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg2.l13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each <math id="alg2.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e\in\Omega" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e\in\Omega</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l14.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="d^{\star}\leftarrow\arg\max_{d:\,|L_{d}|&lt;num_{\max}}\ \textsc{IntraScore}({\bm{A}},L_{d}\cup\{e\})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>arg</mi><msub><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.448em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">IntraScore</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝑨</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d^{\star}\leftarrow\arg\max_{d:\,|L_{d}|&lt;num_{\max}}\ \textsc{IntraScore}({\bm{A}},L_{d}\cup\{e\})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
              
              
              <math id="alg2.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{d^{\star}}\leftarrow L_{d^{\star}}\cup\{e\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{d^{\star}}\leftarrow L_{d^{\star}}\cup\{e\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg2.l16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">17:</span>
              
              
            <math id="alg2.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="need[d]\leftarrow\max(0,\,num_{\min}-|L_{d}|)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">need[d]\leftarrow\max(0,\,num_{\min}-|L_{d}|)</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="alg2.l17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d=1..D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.0835em">.</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.0835em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d=1..D</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="alg2.l17.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S\leftarrow\sum_{d=1}^{D}need[d]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo rspace="0.111em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>D</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S\leftarrow\sum_{d=1}^{D}need[d]</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">18:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg2.l18.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg2.l18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">19:</span>
              
              
              Collect weakest affinity experts from <math id="alg2.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|L_{d}|&gt;num_{\min}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|L_{d}|&gt;num_{\min}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">20:</span>
              
              
              Reassign them to needy groups maximizing <span id="alg2.l20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">IntraScore</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">21:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg2.l21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">22:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg2.l22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg2.l22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{L_{d}\}_{d=1}^{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>D</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{L_{d}\}_{d=1}^{D}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Algorithm for Topology-Aware Routing with Load Prediction</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present two routing policies for replica assignment. Algorithm <a href="#alg3" title="Algorithm 3 ‣ A.3 Algorithm for Topology-Aware Routing with Load Prediction ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ GRACE-MoE: Grouping and Replication with Locality-Aware Routing for Efficient Distributed MoE Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> specifies the weighted polling strategy, while Algorithm <a href="#alg4" title="Algorithm 4 ‣ A.3 Algorithm for Topology-Aware Routing with Load Prediction ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ GRACE-MoE: Grouping and Replication with Locality-Aware Routing for Efficient Distributed MoE Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> incorporates it into a topology-aware routing policy. Together, these ensure that replicas are selected with minimal cross-device communication overhead while maintaining balanced computational load.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg3" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 3</span> </span> Weighted Round-Robin with Load Prediction</figcaption>
<div id="alg3.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg3.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg3.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">function</span> <span id="alg3.l1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ChooseByPollingWeight</span>(polling_weights)

</div>
<div id="alg3.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
              
              
              gpus <math id="alg3.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> keys(polling_weights),  weights <math id="alg3.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> values(polling_weights)

</div>
<div id="alg3.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
              
              
              selected_gpu_id <math id="alg3.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> WeightedRandomChoice(gpus, weights)

</div>
<div id="alg3.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg3.l4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> selected_gpu_id

</div>
<div id="alg3.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg3.l5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg3.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">function</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<figure id="alg4" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 4</span> </span> Topology-Aware Routing with Locality Preference</figcaption>
<div id="alg4.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg4.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
              
              
            token_gpu_id, token_node_id <span id="alg4.l1.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg4.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> GPU and Node ID that the token belongs to
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg4.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
              
              
            replica_gpus <span id="alg4.l2.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg4.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> List of GPU IDs where replicas reside
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg4.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
              
              
            polling_weights: <math id="alg4.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{</annotation></semantics></math>gpu_id <math id="alg4.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> weight<math id="alg4.l3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">}</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
              
              
            local_gpu_replicas <math id="alg4.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow\{\,g\in\text{replica\_gpus}\mid g=\text{token\_gpu\_id}\,\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>replica_gpus</mtext></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>token_gpu_id</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow\{\,g\in\text{replica\_gpus}\mid g=\text{token\_gpu\_id}\,\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
              
              
            local_node_replicas <math id="alg4.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow\{\,g\in\text{replica\_gpus}\mid\text{Node}(g)=\text{token\_node\_id}\,\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>replica_gpus</mtext></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext>Node</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mtext>token_node_id</mtext></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow\{\,g\in\text{replica\_gpus}\mid\text{Node}(g)=\text{token\_node\_id}\,\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg4.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> local_gpu_replicas <math id="alg4.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\neq\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≠</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\neq\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg4.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg4.l7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> token_gpu_id

</div>
<div id="alg4.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg4.l8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else</span> <span id="alg4.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> local_node_replicas <math id="alg4.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\neq\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≠</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\neq\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg4.l8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
              
              
              local_weights <math id="alg4.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> polling_weights restricted to local_node_replicas

</div>
<div id="alg4.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg4.l10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <span id="alg4.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ChooseByPollingWeight</span>(local_weights)

</div>
<div id="alg4.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg4.l11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else</span>
</div>
<div id="alg4.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg4.l12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <span id="alg4.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ChooseByPollingWeight</span>(polling_weights)

</div>
<div id="alg4.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
              
              
