<section id="A1.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.4 </span>Experiment Configurations</h3>

<div id="A1.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Details of the model architectures used for evaluation are summarized in Table <a href="#A1.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ A.4 Experiment Configurations ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ GRACE-MoE: Grouping and Replication with Locality-Aware Routing for Efficient Distributed MoE Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
